 for Salvo and Valentino on their journey home to Sicily — until a Christmas wish comes true.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qeAYXOz8TQuPDKNYRyh8HL8CTrP.jpg","released":"2025-12-05T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"28 min"},{"id":"tt38566460:1:2","season":1,"episode":2,"title":"Episodio 2","overview":"Salvo and Valentino stash away the dumpsters in Sicily and Milan, but the smell of their secret lingers as they trick their partners with a risky scheme.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8YMJ6a1mMLVBmMMDgc2NT3nxt5z.jpg","released":"2025-12-05T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"32 min"},{"id":"tt38566460:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"Episodio 3","overview":"Unable to resist his suspicions, Salvo finds a sneaky use for the dumpsters. Meanwhile, a run-in with the police gets in the way of all-important work.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e61wVJHhRmfuQsSDG7uElXSPJMg.jpg","released":"2025-12-05T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"27 min"},{"id":"tt38566460:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"Episodio 4","overview":"As Salvo and Valentino's new business takes off, the police gather evidence. Claudia and Maria Teresa suspect foul play. A quirky patient is abducted.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pc0bVgbZubivXW4zQxZfns0gfNw.jpg","released":"2025-12-05T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"29 min"},{"id":"tt38566460:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"Episodio 5","overview":"Odd things continue to occur in the run up to Christmas as Palermo fans cause a ruckus, Aurora goes missing and the prime minister holds a board meeting.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5jg5ewfNJLVmq2Qhru2wQrOUsbP.jpg","released":"2025-12-05T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"42 min"}]}}